            ErebosProfile("feet", "自身の移動スキルが終わったとき、着地地点から0.2秒後、0.4秒後、0.6秒後に、それぞれ半径1m、2m、3mの光の波紋を広げる。波紋は光属性ダメージを与え、ダメージはそれぞれ攻撃力・魔力の高い方の4%、5%、6%で、同じ敵には最大3回まで命中する。再発動まで6秒かかる。", "When your movement skill ends, spread Light ripples from your landing location after 0.2, 0.4, and 0.6 seconds, with radii of 1m, 2m, and 3m respectively. They deal Light damage equal to 4%, 5%, and 6% of whichever is higher: your Attack or Ability Power, respectively. Each enemy can be hit up to 3 times. Cooldown: 6 seconds.", "自身移动技能结束时，从落地地点于0.2秒后、0.4秒后、0.6秒后分别扩散半径1m、2m、3m的光之涟漪，分别造成相当于攻击力与法术强度中较高一方4%、5%、6%的光属性伤害。同一敌人最多命中3次。冷却6秒。",
                new[] { C("ErebosRippleFirst",BossErebosBalance.ErebosRippleFirstValue,BossErebosBalance.ErebosRippleFirstCap),C("ErebosRippleSecond",BossErebosBalance.ErebosRippleSecondValue,BossErebosBalance.ErebosRippleSecondCap),C("ErebosRippleThird",BossErebosBalance.ErebosRippleThirdValue,BossErebosBalance.ErebosRippleThirdCap) }, ErebosCircle(BossEvent.MovementCompleted,"ErebosRippleFirst",BossErebosBalance.FeetA0RadiusMilli,BossErebosBalance.FeetA0DelayMillis,BossErebosBalance.FeetA0CooldownMillis), ErebosCircle(BossEvent.Clock,"ErebosRippleSecond",BossErebosBalance.FeetA1RadiusMilli,BossErebosBalance.FeetA1DelayMillis), ErebosCircle(BossEvent.Clock,"ErebosRippleThird",BossErebosBalance.FeetA2RadiusMilli,BossErebosBalance.FeetA2DelayMillis)),
            ErebosProfile("stage2", "記憶を使ったとき、照準地点（8m以内）に、4秒間持続する中心の印を設置する。未消費の印は同時に1個しか存在できず、設置し直すと古い印が置き換えられる。設置物はエレビオス効果全体で最大2個まで。次の通常攻撃が敵に命中したときに印を消費して波紋を発生させ、半径2mの範囲に攻撃力・魔力の高い方の10%、その0.3秒後に半径3mの範囲に攻撃力・魔力の高い方の14%の光属性ダメージを与える。再発動まで6秒かかる。", "When you use a memory, place a center mark at your aim location within 8m for 4 seconds. Only one unconsumed mark can exist; placing another replaces it. Up to 2 placed effects can exist across all Erebos effects. When your next basic attack hits an enemy, consume the mark to create a ripple in a 2m radius dealing 10% of whichever is higher: your Attack or Ability Power, then a Light ripple in a 3m radius after 0.3 seconds dealing 14%. Cooldown: 6 seconds.", "使用记忆时，在瞄准地点（8m以内）设置持续4秒的中心印记。同时只能存在1个未消耗的印记，重新设置会替换旧印记。厄瑞玻斯的所有效果合计最多存在2个放置效果。下一次通常攻击命中敌人时，消耗印记引发涟漪，对半径2m范围造成相当于攻击力与法术强度中较高一方10%的伤害，0.3秒后对半径3m范围造成相当于攻击力与法术强度中较高一方14%的光属性伤害。冷却6秒。",
                new[] { C("ErebosRippleStart",BossErebosBalance.ErebosRippleStartValue,BossErebosBalance.ErebosRippleStartCap),C("ErebosRippleEnd",BossErebosBalance.ErebosRippleEndValue,BossErebosBalance.ErebosRippleEndCap) }, new BossAction(BossEvent.MemoryUse,BossMechanism.Field,BossPayload.Mark,lifetimeMillis:BossErebosBalance.Stage2A0LifetimeMillis,maxInstances:BossErebosBalance.Stage2A0MaxInstances,radiusMilli:BossErebosBalance.Stage2A0RadiusMilli,rangeMilli:BossErebosBalance.Stage2A0RangeMilli,replaceOldest:true,element:BossElement.Light), ErebosCircle(BossEvent.MainHit,"ErebosRippleStart",BossErebosBalance.Stage2A1RadiusMilli,BossErebosBalance.Stage2A1DelayMillis,BossErebosBalance.Stage2A1CooldownMillis), ErebosCircle(BossEvent.Clock,"ErebosRippleEnd",BossErebosBalance.Stage2A2RadiusMilli,BossErebosBalance.Stage2A2DelayMillis)),
            ErebosProfile("stage3", "印の待機中に自身の移動スキルを終えると、効果が「押し出し」から「引き寄せ」に変わる。この変化は印1個につき1回だけで、押し出しには戻らない。波紋が発生する直前に、半径3m以内の敵最大3体を、0.3秒かけて外側（変化したときは内側）へ最大0.8m動かす。ボスと行動妨害が効かない敵は動かない。印を消費すると境界の印を1つ得る。境界の印は持続12秒、最大3個までたまる。", "Completing your movement skill while a mark is waiting changes its push into a pull. This can happen only once per mark and cannot be reversed. Just before the ripple appears, move up to 3 enemies within 3m outward, or inward after the change, up to 0.8m over 0.3 seconds. Bosses and enemies immune to crowd control are not moved. Consuming the mark grants one boundary mark, lasting 12 seconds and stacking up to 3 times.", "印记等待期间结束自身移动技能时，将效果从“推开”改为“拉近”。每个印记只能改变1次，无法改回推开。涟漪出现前，在0.3秒内将半径3m以内最多3名敌人向外（改变后向内）移动最多0.8m。首领和免疫控制的敌人不会被移动。消耗印记时获得1个边界印记，持续12秒，最多积累3个。",
                new[] { C("ErebosPolarity",BossErebosBalance.ErebosPolarityValue,BossErebosBalance.ErebosPolarityCap,BossCoefficientKind.Distance) }, new BossAction(BossEvent.MovementCompleted,BossMechanism.Ledger,BossPayload.Mode,count:BossErebosBalance.Stage3A0Count,maxInstances:BossErebosBalance.Stage3A0MaxInstances,lifetimeMillis:BossErebosBalance.Stage3A0LifetimeMillis,radiusMilli:BossErebosBalance.Stage3A0RadiusMilli,magnitudeMilli:BossErebosBalance.Stage3A0MagnitudeMilli,element:BossElement.Light), new BossAction(BossEvent.MainHit,BossMechanism.Ledger,BossPayload.Mark,count:BossErebosBalance.Stage3A1Count,maxInstances:BossErebosBalance.Stage3A1MaxInstances,lifetimeMillis:BossErebosBalance.Stage3A1LifetimeMillis,element:BossElement.Light)),
            ErebosProfile("stage6", "境界の印が3個たまった状態で記憶を使ったとき、全ての印を消費して、照準地点（8m以内）に半径4mの星域を3秒間展開し、自身は攻撃力・魔力の高い方の38%（上限40%）の障壁を3秒間得る。星域の展開から2秒後、中心で直交する2本の直線（長さ6m、幅0.6m）を0.5秒間予告した後、各攻撃力・魔力の高い方の22.5%の光属性ダメージを与える。3秒後には中心から半径4mの円形の範囲に攻撃力・魔力の高い方の45%の光属性ダメージを発生させる。直線が発動する前（2.5秒以内）に移動スキルを終えると、直線の向きを着地地点の方向へ1回だけ変更できる。移動しなくても直線は発動する。再発動まで10秒かかる。", "When you use a memory with 3 boundary marks, consume them all to create a starfield with a 4m radius at your aim location within 8m for 3 seconds. Also gain a shield for 3 seconds equal to 38% of whichever is higher: your Attack or Ability Power (cap: 40%). After 2 seconds, show a warning for 0.5 seconds along two perpendicular lines crossing at the center, each 6m long and 0.6m wide, then deal Light damage along each equal to 22.5%. After 3 seconds, deal Light damage in a 4m radius from the center equal to 45%. Completing a movement skill before the lines fire, within 2.5 seconds, can reorient them toward your landing location once. They fire even if you do not move. Cooldown: 10 seconds.", "持有3个边界印记时使用记忆，消耗全部印记，在瞄准地点（8m以内）展开半径4m的星域，持续3秒，并获得相当于攻击力与法术强度中较高一方38%（上限40%）的护盾，持续3秒。星域展开2秒后，沿中心相互垂直的2条直线（长6m、宽0.6m）显示0.5秒的预警，随后各造成相当于攻击力与法术强度中较高一方22.5%的光属性伤害。3秒后，从中心对半径4m的圆形范围造成相当于攻击力与法术强度中较高一方45%的光属性伤害。直线发动前（2.5秒以内）结束移动技能，可将直线朝向改为落地地点的方向，仅限1次。即使不移动，直线也会发动。冷却10秒。",
                new[] { C("ErebosFinale",BossErebosBalance.ErebosFinaleValue,BossErebosBalance.ErebosFinaleCap), C("ErebosFinaleShield",BossErebosBalance.ErebosFinaleShieldValue,BossErebosBalance.ErebosFinaleShieldCap,BossCoefficientKind.Shield) }, ErebosCircle(BossEvent.MemoryUse,"ErebosFinale",BossErebosBalance.Stage6A0RadiusMilli,BossErebosBalance.Stage6A0DelayMillis,BossErebosBalance.Stage6A0CooldownMillis,BossErebosBalance.Stage6A0LifetimeMillis), new BossAction(BossEvent.Clock,BossMechanism.ShapeAttack,BossPayload.Damage,"ErebosFinale",BossShape.Line,delayMillis:BossErebosBalance.Stage6A1DelayMillis,maxInstances:BossErebosBalance.Stage6A1MaxInstances,count:BossErebosBalance.Stage6A1Count,rangeMilli:BossErebosBalance.Stage6A1RangeMilli,widthMilli:BossErebosBalance.Stage6A1WidthMilli,element:BossElement.Light), new BossAction(BossEvent.MemoryUse,BossMechanism.Defense,BossPayload.Shield,"ErebosFinaleShield",lifetimeMillis:BossErebosBalance.Stage6A2LifetimeMillis,maxInstances:BossErebosBalance.Stage6A2MaxInstances,element:BossElement.Light)),
        };
        internal static BossRewardProfile[] CreateErebosRewards()
        {
            BossRewardAction Delay() => new BossRewardAction(BossRewardActionKind.NativeInterval,BossErebosBalance.RewardDelayValueMilli,BossErebosBalance.RewardDelayCapMilli,durationMillis:BossErebosBalance.RewardDelayDurationMillis,order:0);
            BossRewardAction Attract() => new BossRewardAction(BossRewardActionKind.NativeState,BossErebosBalance.RewardAttractValueMilli,BossErebosBalance.RewardAttractCapMilli,rangeMilli:BossErebosBalance.RewardAttractRangeMilli,order:1);
            BossRewardAction Tick() => new BossRewardAction(BossRewardActionKind.NativeState,BossErebosBalance.RewardTickValueMilli,BossErebosBalance.RewardTickCapMilli,rangeMilli:BossErebosBalance.RewardTickRangeMilli,order:2);
            BossRewardAction Relocate() => new BossRewardAction(BossRewardActionKind.NativeTarget,BossErebosBalance.RewardRelocateValueMilli,BossErebosBalance.RewardRelocateCapMilli,count:BossErebosBalance.RewardRelocateCount,rangeMilli:BossErebosBalance.RewardRelocateRangeMilli,order:3);
            BossRewardAction Duration() => new BossRewardAction(BossRewardActionKind.NativeInterval,BossErebosBalance.RewardDurationValueMilli,BossErebosBalance.RewardDurationCapMilli,durationMillis:BossErebosBalance.RewardDurationDurationMillis,order:4);
            return new[] { new BossRewardProfile(ErebosRewardId,ErebosSetId,"Gem_U_LastStarlight",BossRewardAdapter.LastStarlight,new[]
            {
                new BossRewardStage(1,new Txt("「ラストスターライト」の発動準備時間を、最大0.20秒短くする。0.25秒未満には短くならない。装備を外すと元の待機時間に戻る。", "Reduce Last Starlight's preparation time by up to 0.20 seconds, without reducing it below 0.25 seconds. Unequipping restores its original waiting time.", "将“最后的星光”的准备时间缩短最多0.20秒，最低不低于0.25秒。卸下装备后恢复原有等待时间。"),new[] { Delay() }),
